INT. KITCHEN - NIGHT

Action after a heading.

EXT. CREEK - DAY #1A#

est. RIDGE - DUSK

INT./EXT. TRUCK - CONTINUOUS

I/E BARN - LATER

.MONTAGE - THE SEASONS TURN

..an action line that starts with two dots.

INT. THIS ONE HAS NO BLANK AFTER
so the line above is NOT a heading (no blank after) — and per the spec's letter it becomes a CHARACTER cue (all caps, blank before, non-blank after), making this line dialogue. Spec-faithful, surprising, and exactly the trap the real corpus documents.
